application "Left Aligned Greeting" is console

model Greeting
field message is text
that is all

controller Greeter
action "choose greeting"
set "person is known" to yes
if value called "person is known" is yes
set message to "Hello from left aligned Hyperian"
otherwise
set message to "Hello, stranger"
that is all
that is all

when application starts
run action "choose greeting"
show view "greeting"
that is all
that is all

view "greeting"
heading "Every sentence begins at the left edge"
show message
that is all
